{"4225190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BoomScroll", "steam_appid": 4225190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>HOW FAR WILL YOU SCROLL?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BoomScroll is the hand-drawn bullet heaven where you go up, UP, and <strong><u>UP!</u></strong><br>Find new weapons, level up, grab loot, recruit new characters, and make it as far as you can!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225190/extras/fe1b4e580c6e19af2650038d54339205.poster.avif?t=1783726962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225190/extras/fe1b4e580c6e19af2650038d54339205.webm?t=1783726962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225190/extras/fe1b4e580c6e19af2650038d54339205.mp4?t=1783726962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>BREAK THE GAME, BECOME UNTOUCHABLE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat as many goofy creatures as you can, and grab XP to level up!  <br>Overpower your enemies by concocting the strongest unique build you can muster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225190/extras/45c76c8d6b13e95244dfb8a05b6e2fd2.poster.avif?t=1783726962\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225190/extras/45c76c8d6b13e95244dfb8a05b6e2fd2.webm?t=1783726962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4225190/extra